<td>Fintech/Crypto, Banking, Insurance, Personal Finance Tracker, Invoice &amp; Billing Tool</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Healthcare</strong></td>
<td>Medical Clinic, Pharmacy, Dental, Veterinary, Mental Health, Medication Reminder</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>E-commerce</strong></td>
<td>General, Luxury, Marketplace (P2P), Subscription Box, Food Delivery</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Services</strong></td>
<td>Beauty/Spa, Restaurant, Hotel, Legal, Home Services, Booking &amp; Appointment</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Creative</strong></td>
<td>Portfolio, Agency, Photography, Gaming, Music Streaming, Photo/Video Editor</td>
</tr>
<tr>
