<p dir="auto"><strong>Supported:</strong> Claude Code, Cursor, Windsurf, Antigravity, Codex CLI, Continue, Gemini CLI, OpenCode, Qoder, CodeBuddy, Droid (Factory), KiloCode, Warp, Augment, CodeWhale, ZCode, Amazon Q Developer</p>
<p dir="auto">The skill activates automatically when you request UI/UX work. Just chat naturally:</p>
